<title>UK: Kvaerner wins 27 mln stg ship contract.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner wins 27 mln stg ship contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipbuilding group Kvaerner ASA said on Wednesday its unit Kvaerner Govan had won a 27 million stg contract from Toisa Ltd for two platform supply vessels.</p>
<p>Kvaerner said the ships would be used in the specialised construction and remote operated vehicle support markets.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
